{
  "name": "home-folders-remove",
  "description": "The page reads the registry of two projects whose first folder does not exist, shows the missing folder as an error notice, asks the host for both folders, and removes the first project from the project home: the host answers the removal question and the release, removes the project from the registry, answers the registry without it, and keeps the folder of the remaining project.",
  "replay": false,
  "reason": "The case calls windowReady, projectFolder, projectRemoveAsk, projectRelease and sidecarsRetain, which only the native host with windows answers (docs/spec/cases/page-wire/README.md#producer-runs).",
